{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">病理基础模型：从 patch encoder 到 whole-slide 多模态推理</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Pathology Foundations</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_040_conch-title\">CONCH</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在病理领域把 CLIP 式全局对比与 CoCa 式图像条件 caption decoder 联合训练，同时服务判别与生成。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">CoCa-style computational pathology vision–language foundation model jointly trained with contrastive image–text alignment and generative caption decoding on 1.17M pairs.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">组织病理图像与人工生成的病理文本描述</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Histopathology image tile/ROI + paired pathology text description or prompt</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">病理图文共享表征及图像条件文本生成</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Shared multimodal retrieval/zero-shot embeddings + autoregressive pathology caption/text generation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1(c) · PDF p.Official HTML Figure 1 asset</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-024-02856-4\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_040_conch')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_040_conch')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"CONCH original paper architecture figure, Figure 1(c)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/12486ce6f5f7de5bf583.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1(c) · PDF p.Official HTML Figure 1 asset</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_040_conch\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_040_conch')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_040_conch\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">病理图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Histopathology Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">组织图像进入视觉 encoder，保留供对比与生成使用的视觉 tokens。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests histopathology image tile/roi + paired pathology text description or prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (Histopathology Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"组织图像进入视觉 encoder，保留供对比与生成使用的视觉 tokens。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests histopathology image tile/roi + paired pathology text description or prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (Histopathology Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"病理图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Histopathology Image\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">病理图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Histopathology Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">组织图像进入视觉 encoder，保留供对比与生成使用的视觉 tokens。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests histopathology image tile/roi + paired pathology text description or prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (Histopathology Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ViT 将病理形态编码为全局向量和空间 token 序列。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Image Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ViT 将病理形态编码为全局向量和空间 token 序列。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由人类撰写/筛选的病理描述提供细粒度形态与诊断语义。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Caption within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"病理 Caption\" data-node-name-en=\"Caption\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">病理 Caption</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Caption</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由人类撰写/筛选的病理描述提供细粒度形态与诊断语义。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Caption within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"语言 Transformer 把 caption 编码为全局文本向量。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Text Encoder within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Text Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Text Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Text Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">语言 Transformer 把 caption 编码为全局文本向量。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Text Encoder within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"图像与文本全局向量投影、归一化后进入共同空间。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs embedding within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"共享嵌入\" data-node-name-en=\"embedding\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">共享嵌入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像与文本全局向量投影、归一化后进入共同空间。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs embedding within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CoCa 式 contrastive loss 对齐配对图像与文本并分离非配对样本。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Image–Text Contrastive Loss within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"图文对比\" data-node-name-en=\"Image–Text Contrastive Loss\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对比</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Image–Text Contrastive Loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CoCa 式 contrastive loss 对齐配对图像与文本并分离非配对样本。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Image–Text Contrastive Loss within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"文本解码器以因果 self-attention 和对视觉 tokens 的 cross-attention 生成 caption。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Multimodal Decoder within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Multimodal Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Multimodal Decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Multimodal Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">文本解码器以因果 self-attention 和对视觉 tokens 的 cross-attention 生成 caption。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Multimodal Decoder within the core pathology contrastive captioner computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"teacher-forcing 的 next-token loss 要求视觉特征保留可描述的细节。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Captioning Loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Captioning Loss\" data-node-name-en=\"Captioning Loss\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Captioning Loss</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">teacher-forcing 的 next-token loss 要求视觉特征保留可描述的细节。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Captioning Loss to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"支持零样本分类、图文/图图检索、分割适配与图像描述。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces shared multimodal retrieval/zero-shot embeddings + autoregressive pathology caption/text generation via CONCH representation.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"CONCH 表征\" data-node-name-en=\"CONCH representation\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_040_conch', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">CONCH 表征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CONCH representation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">支持零样本分类、图文/图图检索、分割适配与图像描述。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces shared multimodal retrieval/zero-shot embeddings + autoregressive pathology caption/text generation via CONCH representation.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"CONCH Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · CONCH 联合图文对比与图像条件 captioning</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Joint Contrastive Image–Text Alignment &amp; Cross-Attended Generative Caption Loss</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"CONCH：核心公式 · CONCH 联合图文对比与图像条件 captioning\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"40\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"28.658623pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -67.993583 202.854937 28.658623\" width=\"202.854937pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m040_g23-103\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g20-103\"></use><use id=\"m040_g23-108\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g20-108\"></use><use id=\"m040_g23-111\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g20-111\"></use><path d=\"M5.697191-2.272921V-2.828745H.615376V-2.272921H5.697191Z\" id=\"m040_g10-0\"></path><path d=\"M7.364661-.665003L7.315034-.764257C6.888241-.297763 6.26294 0 5.627713 0C4.545842 0 3.503673-.327539 2.47143-.595525C3.5533-1.558291 4.168676-2.650087 4.406886-4.079348C4.525991-4.823754 4.635171-6.511075 5.67734-6.511075C6.114059-6.511075 6.491225-6.352269 6.491225-5.855998C6.491225-5.657489 6.39197-5.468906 6.253014-5.32995V-5.220771C6.491225-5.300174 7.265407-5.657489 7.265407-5.945326C7.265407-6.580553 6.441597-6.838614 5.925476-6.838614C3.215836-6.838614 3.384568-4.02972 2.858521-2.133965C2.769192-1.796501 2.302697-.744406 1.895755-.744406C1.617843-.744406 1.349857-.853586 1.071945-.853586C.704705-.853586 .208434-.12903 .069478 .168732L.119105 .23821C.287837 .099254 .535973-.059553 .764257-.059553C2.441653-.059553 3.980093 .853586 5.657489 .853586C6.669882 .853586 7.066899 .198508 7.364661-.665003Z\" id=\"m040_g10-76\"></path><path d=\"M1.270454 1.915606V-7.017272H.71463V1.915606H1.270454Z\" id=\"m040_g10-106\"></path><path d=\"M2.927999-7.116526C1.488813-6.183537 .47642-4.575619 .47642-2.550833C.47