xlink:href=\"#m040_g10-185\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"92.353827\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g16-50\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"97.172263\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g13-67\" y=\"-49.581084\"></use><use x=\"103.781668\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g10-106\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"109.049617\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g16-50\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"113.984416\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g13-159\" y=\"-49.581084\"></use><use x=\"119.126235\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g13-67\" y=\"-49.581084\"></use><use x=\"122.569796\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g16-150\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"127.238901\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g16-30\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use><use x=\"131.283716\" xlink:href=\"#m040_g10-186\" y=\"-51.075465\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">vision-only 病理 encoder 缺少 zero-shot 与跨模态检索接口</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Vision-only pathology foundation models (UNI, Virchow) lack native text interfaces for zero-shot classification or cross-modal search.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以 117 万病理 image-caption pairs 学开放语义视觉语言表示</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Pretrain a ViT vision encoder, text encoder, and multimodal caption decoder on 1.17M curated human histopathology image–caption pairs.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">病理专科图文对齐，统一分类、检索、caption 和分割迁移</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Unifies CLIP-style dual-encoder retrieval/zero-shot transfer with CoCa-style generative captioning in computational pathology.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">支持病理 zero-shot/few-shot 和文本驱动检索</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Enables zero-shot cancer subtyping, text-to-tile search, WSI zero-shot MI-Zero classification, and pathology captioning.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">独立 benchmark 表现强；caption 构造和术语覆盖决定上限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Top-performing multimodal pathology foundation model; performance is bounded by educational/caption terminology coverage.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">对比目标学习可检索、可零样本分类的全局图文几何；caption 目标迫使视觉 tokens 保留生成所需细节。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">multimodal decoder 通过 cross-attention 在每个生成 token 时读取病理图像，而不只依赖单一全局向量。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">人类病理描述比通用网络 alt-text 更贴近领域概念，使开放词汇表征具有专业语义。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Pretrain a ViT vision encoder, text encoder, and multimodal caption decoder on 1.17M curated human histopathology image–caption pairs.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Unifies CLIP-style dual-encoder retrieval/zero-shot transfer with CoCa-style generative captioning in computational pathology.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Joint Contrastive Image–Text Alignment &amp; Cross-Attended Generative Caption Loss.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">同一 backbone 可连接检索、零样本和生成，但生成内容必须以图像证据和不确定性机制约束。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">病理 caption 覆盖和语言风格会限定开放词汇边界；罕见病种不能仅凭通用相似度宣称可靠。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Enables zero-shot cancer subtyping, text-to-tile search, WSI zero-shot MI-Zero classification, and pathology captioning.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Top-performing multimodal pathology foundation model; performance is bounded by educational/caption terminology coverage.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41591-024-02856-4\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>A Visual-Language Foundation Model for Computational Pathology</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/mahmoodlab/CONCH\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}